            "line_count": 3,
            "preview": "// Year Day (month 13, day 29) always has 29 days even in non-leap years InternationalFixedDate yearDay1900 = InternationalFixedDate.of(1900, 13, 29); assertEquals(29, yearDay1900.lengthOfMonth());"
          },
