            "line_count": 3,
            "preview": "// Year 2000 is a leap year (divisible by 400); month 13 still has 29 days InternationalFixedDate yearDay2000 = InternationalFixedDate.of(2000, 13, 29); assertEquals(29, yearDay2000.lengthOfMonth());"
          },
